[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.74,
    "text": "Science shows that your brain"
  },
  {
    "start": 1.74,
    "end": 3.6,
    "text": "and your best friend's brain literally"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.6,
    "end": 5.79256,
    "text": "sync up together like Bluetooth,"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.79256,
    "end": 7.33256,
    "text": "which explains how the two of you"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.33256,
    "end": 8.25256,
    "text": "managed to share a"
  },
  {
    "start": 8.25256,
    "end": 9.94896,
    "text": "single functioning brain cell."
  },
  {
    "start": 9.94896,
    "end": 11.00896,
    "text": "In neuroscience,"
  },
  {
    "start": 11.00896,
    "end": 12.45335,
    "text": "it's called neurosynchrony,"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.45335,
    "end": 14.01335,
    "text": "and it's the biological reason"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.01335,
    "end": 14.41335,
    "text": "you can"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.41335,
    "end": 16.17335,
    "text": "finish each other's sentences,"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.17335,
    "end": 17.01335,
    "text": "communicate with a"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.01335,
    "end": 18.33335,
    "text": "single unhinged glance"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.33335,
    "end": 19.69065,
    "text": "across a crowded room,"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.69065,
    "end": 21.41065,
    "text": "and laugh at the exact same"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.41065,
    "end": 22.83065,
    "text": "dark, twisted stuff"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.83065,
    "end": 24.66265,
    "text": "that would get you both cancelled."
  },
  {
    "start": 24.66265,
    "end": 26.00265,
    "text": "See, when you spend enough"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.00265,
    "end": 27.36265,
    "text": "time around someone,"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.36265,
    "end": 28.74265,
    "text": "your brains actually physically"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.74265,
    "end": 30.78265,
    "text": "align their electrical rhythms,"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.78265,
    "end": 31.80265,
    "text": "called brain waves,"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.80265,
    "end": 33.08035,
    "text": "using mirror neurons,"
  },
  {
    "start": 33.08035,
    "end": 34.80035,
    "text": "which are specialized brain cells that"
  },
  {
    "start": 34.80035,
    "end": 36.80035,
    "text": "copy and mimic the exact behavior"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.80035,
    "end": 37.74035,
    "text": "and feelings of"
  },
  {
    "start": 37.74035,
    "end": 39.74106,
    "text": "the person sitting next to you."
  },
  {
    "start": 39.74106,
    "end": 40.88106,
    "text": "When neuroscientists threw"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.88106,
    "end": 42.88106,
    "text": "best friends into brain scanners,"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.88106,
    "end": 44.24106,
    "text": "they found identical,"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.24106,
    "end": 45.92106,
    "text": "synchronized electrical spikes"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.92106,
    "end": 46.66106,
    "text": "lighting up the"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.66106,
    "end": 47.86106,
    "text": "exact same regions"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.86106,
    "end": 49.94106,
    "text": "at the exact same millisecond."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.94106,
    "end": 51.16106,
    "text": "The amygdala,"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.16106,
    "end": 52.84206,
    "text": "which processes raw emotion,"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.84206,
    "end": 54.18206,
    "text": "the prefrontal cortex,"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.18206,
    "end": 55.72206,
    "text": "which handles decision making,"
  },
  {
    "start": 55.72206,
    "end": 56.76206,
    "text": "or in your case,"
  },
  {
    "start": 56.76206,
    "end": 58.10996,
    "text": "terrible life choices,"
  },
  {
    "start": 58.10996,
    "end": 58.52996,
    "text": "and the"
  },
  {
    "start": 58.52996,
    "end": 60.42535,
    "text": "neural circuits for empathy."
  },
  {
    "start": 60.42535,
    "end": 62.06535,
    "text": "It explains why you and your best friend"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.06535,
    "end": 64.30535,
    "text": "are such insufferable weirdos together,"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.30535,
    "end": 65.62535,
    "text": "because your nervous systems"
  },
  {
    "start": 65.62535,
    "end": 66.24535,
    "text": "are literally"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.24535,
    "end": 67.93715,
    "text": "trapped in an echo chamber."
  },
  {
    "start": 67.93715,
    "end": 70.05385,
    "text": "But here is the terrifying part."
  },
  {
    "start": 70.05385,
    "end": 70.89385,
    "text": "It also proves"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.89385,
    "end": 71.41385,
    "text": "you need to"
  },
  {
    "start": 71.41385,
    "end": 72.99556,
    "text": "choose your circle wisely."
  },
  {
    "start": 72.99556,
    "end": 74.21556,
    "text": "If your best friend is a"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.21556,
    "end": 75.63556,
    "text": "broke, toxic disaster"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.63556,
    "end": 76.81556,
    "text": "with zero ambition,"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.81556,
    "end": 77.79556,
    "text": "your brain"
  },
  {
    "start": 77.79556,
    "end": 78.31556,
    "text": "isn't just"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.31556,
    "end": 79.66665,
    "text": "hanging out with them."
  },
  {
    "start": 79.66665,
    "end": 80.34665,
    "text": "It is actively"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.34665,
    "end": 81.28665,
    "text": "downloading their"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.28665,
    "end": 82.50665,
    "text": "broken neural wiring"
  },
  {
    "start": 82.50665,
    "end": 83.36665,
    "text": "and rewriting"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.36665,
    "end": 86.23333333333333,
    "text": "who you are going to become."
  }
]